1. Astute 🧠

Very clever at understanding situations.
Tamil: கூர்மையான அறிவுடைய
Synonyms: Shrewd, Sharp, Clever
🧠 Astute = sharp mind

2. Ingenious 💡

Clever and creative at solving problems.
Tamil: புத்திசாலித்தனமான / புதுமையான
Synonyms: Inventive, Innovative, Resourceful
🧠 Ingenious = clever idea

3. Shrewd 🎯

Good at judging people or situations, especially for your own benefit.
Tamil: சாதுரியமான / தந்திரமான
Synonyms: Astute, Cunning, Sharp
🧠 Shrewd = street-smart

4. Savvy 📱

Having practical knowledge and good judgment about something.
Tamil: நடைமுறை அறிவுள்ள
Synonyms: Knowledgeable, Smart, Skilled
🧠 Tech-savvy = good with technology

5. Resourceful 🛠️

Good at finding clever ways to solve problems.
Tamil: சமயோசிதமாக தீர்வு காணக்கூடிய
Synonyms: Ingenious, Capable, Inventive
🧠 Resources + full → knows how to use available things.

6. Canny 🦊

Clever and careful, especially when making decisions.
Tamil: புத்திசாலித்தனமான / எச்சரிக்கையான
Synonyms: Shrewd, Clever, Wily
🧠 Canny = careful cleverness.

7. Witty 😂

Clever and funny in what you say.
Tamil: நகைச்சுவையுடன் புத்திசாலித்தனமாக பேசுபவர்
Synonyms: Clever, Humorous, Quick-witted
🧠 Wit = clever humor.

8. Astounding 😲

Extremely surprising or impressive.
Tamil: வியக்கத்தக்க
Synonyms: Astonishing, Amazing, Remarkable
🧠 Astonishing → Astounding

9. Erudite 📚

Having a lot of knowledge, especially from study.
Tamil: புலமைமிக்க / ஆழ்ந்த அறிவுடைய
Synonyms: Learned, Scholarly, Knowledgeable
🧠 Erudite → educated + knowledgeable.

10. Polymath 🌟

A person who has deep knowledge in many different subjects.
Tamil: பல துறைகளில் அறிவுடையவர்
Synonyms: Intellectual, Scholar, Multitalented person
🧠 Poly = many + math = learning → knows many fields.
